  "body": "Beautifully presented and thoughtfully designed, this exceptional family residence delivers an effortless combination of contemporary style, quality craftsmanship, and relaxed coastal living. Set within a tightly held and highly sought-after pocket of Kohimarama, this impressive home offers privacy, sunshine, and lifestyle just moments from the beach.\r\n\r\nGenerous proportions, high ceilings, and an abundance of natural light create a welcoming sense of space throughout, while carefully selected finishes and quality fittings add a sophisticated touch. Every element has been considered to provide a home that is both stylish and highly functional.\r\n\r\nThe spacious living and dining areas open effortlessly through large French doors to a private outdoor entertaining space. A sun-drenched deck and established, easy-care garden with astro-turf lawns provide the perfect setting for morning coffee, relaxed afternoons, or alfresco dining with family and friends. A gas fire adds warmth and ambience, creating a cozy and inviting atmosphere year-round.\r\n\r\nThe home features three generous bedrooms, including a master with its own ensuite and custom-fitted wardrobe. A versatile study or additional living space provides flexibility for working from home or extra family living. Two beautifully designed bathrooms, plus a separate powder room on the main floor for guests.\r\n\r\nSecure double internal-access garaging and substantial storage options provide plenty of room for vehicles, recreational equipment, and modern living essentials. Adding to the appeal is access to a shared swimming pool, offering a wonderful option for summer relaxation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of Kohimarama, this outstanding residence places you within easy walking distance of the beach, local parks, public transport, and everyday amenities. The vibrant cafés, restaurants, and waterfront attractions of Mission Bay and St Heliers are also just a leisurely stroll away.\r\n\r\nA home that is easy to live in, effortless to enjoy, and one you will be proud to call your own.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you would like to arrange a private viewing or require further information.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctional agents welcome.",
